@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

title System Sequence Diagram (SSD) - Register DSL Plugin

actor "Drone Tech" as USER
participant ":System" as System

autonumber

USER -> System : Register DSL Plugin
activate System

System --> USER : Request DSL Version and Class Name
deactivate System

USER -> System : Provide DSL Version and Class Name
activate System

System --> USER : Display plugin info or error
deactivate System

@enduml
